# Rayfin packages live on the public Microsoft package feed, not GitHub
# Packages. Some machines have a user-level .npmrc that maps the whole
# @microsoft scope to GitHub Packages (which answers 401 for rayfin). npm
# reads .npmrc from this project root plus the user/global levels only — it
# does not walk up to the gallery root — so the scope pin is repeated here.
@microsoft:registry=https://packagefeedproxy.microsoft.io/npm/
